abstract: "15860 machine-extracted findings from 2605 papers on Ehlers-Danlos syndromes (all 2017-classification types) and hypermobility spectrum disorder. Tier-2 (pre-2019) EDS findings, first build; well-formedness QA only — scientific fidelity of extracted findings has not been human-adjudicated. Scientific fidelity is unmeasured."
